// P7.6: choices and gathers.
* Plain choice
* [Only in the choice] Then the output.
* Start [choice only] inner
+ Sticky choice
* (label) Labelled
* {visited} Conditional
* {a} {b}
  Several conditions
* (both) {a} Label and condition
* -> fallback
* Divert at the end -> somewhere
* [Bracket] -> somewhere
** Nested choice
*** Deeper
* * Spaced bullets
- Gather
- (named) Named gather
-- Nested gather
- - Spaced gather
-
Text after a bare gather.
*   -> invisible
